@base = http://localhost:4004

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Dashboard
POST {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/getDashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Price changes
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/PriceChangeRequests?$expand=supplier,grade

### Pricing Workbench golden summary
POST {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/getPricingWorkbench
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceChangeID": "72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
}

### Valid contract search for the seeded supplier and part
POST {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/searchValidContractItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierID": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "materialID": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "plant": "1000",
  "businessDate": "2026-10-28"
}

### Effective BOM hierarchy for the seeded part
POST {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/getBomHierarchy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialID": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "plant": "1000",
  "keyDate": "2026-10-28"
}

### Governed vendor-part linkages
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/VendorPartLinkages?$expand=supplier,material,contractItem($expand=contract)

### Composition profiles and workflow findings
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/PartProfiles?$expand=material,supplier,contractItem,bomHeader

### Workflow findings
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/WorkflowExceptions?$orderby=createdAt desc

### Price reconciliation evidence
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/ReconciliationRecords?$orderby=createdAt desc

### Calculation runs
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/CalculationRuns?$expand=priceChange

### Admin settings
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/admin/AppSettings

### Mutating workflows
# Use the SAPUI5 demo for version-aware mutations. Actions require expectedVersion
# and the applicable Buyer, RM Admin, Approver, Finance or Auditor persona.
